comments.body:
@Sarah Isgur 

I’d say that when someone incites a violent insurrection and conspires with all manner of shady characters to produce a fake slate (oh, excuse me, “alternative”) electors to overturn a legitimate election and the will of the people, then that person is no longer granted the benefit of trust. Fool me once. 

Enough with this both-sides nonsense. Your readers see this for what it is: disingenuous, to put it politely.
